3. **Loop Pipelining/Unrolling in Child Functions:** Assuming the inlined child functions contain loops, the tool can apply automatic pipelining or unrolling based on global HLS settings, further reducing latency.

This approach leverages the HLS tool's ability to optimize inlined code while maintaining the original logic and function signature.
